1
00:00:00,549 --> 00:00:02,134
[indistinct chatter]

2
00:00:04,511 --> 00:00:06,013
I'm starving.

3
00:00:06,096 --> 00:00:08,432
Yeah, we gotta fuel up first!

4
00:00:08,515 --> 00:00:09,683
What do you feel like eating?

5
00:00:09,766 --> 00:00:11,184
Baked potato!

6
00:00:11,268 --> 00:00:12,436
[Nagisa chuckles] Oh, nice.

7
00:00:12,519 --> 00:00:14,020
What about <i>takoyaki?</i>

8
00:00:14,104 --> 00:00:15,522
[exclaims] Guys, look!

9
00:00:15,605 --> 00:00:16,940
Everybody, check it out!

10
00:00:17,774 --> 00:00:19,693
[Mariko] Aren't they first-years
at our school?

11
00:00:20,944 --> 00:00:22,446
[Sana] I wonder if they're on a date!

12
00:00:23,113 --> 00:00:27,325
Aww, she's wearing a <i>yukata!</i>
Her hair is really cute, too!

13
00:00:27,409 --> 00:00:28,952
[Akari] I love their rom-com vibes!

14
00:00:36,126 --> 00:00:38,128
[opening theme song playing]

15
00:00:39,212 --> 00:00:42,466
BLUE BOX

16
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:04,923
BLUE BOX

17
00:02:05,632 --> 00:02:08,510
{\an8}EPISODE 12
GIRLS...

18
00:02:08,593 --> 00:02:09,928
{\an8}[Taiki] <i>She's so quiet.</i>

19
00:02:10,804 --> 00:02:13,849
<i>She's never been this quiet
around me for this long.</i>

20
00:02:15,976 --> 00:02:18,687
- I'm gonna go get some yakisoba!
- Huh?

21
00:02:18,770 --> 00:02:20,981
Oh, if you're buying stuff, I'll come--

22
00:02:22,983 --> 00:02:24,067
[gasps softly]

23
00:02:27,028 --> 00:02:29,197
[Hina] <i>This whole situation
has me nervous.</i>

24
00:02:30,031 --> 00:02:32,450
<i>I did want it to be just the two of us.</i>

25
00:02:32,534 --> 00:02:35,620
<i>But Kyo cancelling last-minute
caught me off-guard.</i>

26
00:02:36,204 --> 00:02:37,122
Just us?

27
00:02:37,706 --> 00:02:38,832
[groans]

28
00:02:38,915 --> 00:02:39,749
I'M STILL IN

29
00:02:41,543 --> 00:02:42,460
[girls laughing]

30
00:02:42,544 --> 00:02:43,962
[girl] I've kinda been pigging out.

31
00:02:44,588 --> 00:02:46,882
[Hina] <i>I wonder
if my lip gloss is everywhere.</i>

32
00:02:46,965 --> 00:02:49,259
<i>I did eat a candy apple.</i>

33
00:02:49,342 --> 00:02:53,263
<i>Do my bangs look okay?
I hope my</i> obi's <i>not crooked.</i>

34
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:56,182
[sighs]

35
00:02:57,434 --> 00:02:58,435
YAKISOBA
500 YEN

36
00:02:58,518 --> 00:03:01,104
<i>- Truth is, I really want him to see me.</i>
- Hi there!

37
00:03:01,187 --> 00:03:03,815
- That'll be exactly...
<i>- I went to all this trouble</i>

38
00:03:03,899 --> 00:03:07,611
<i>so if there's any chance,
I want him to think I look pretty.</i>

39
00:03:08,612 --> 00:03:11,489
{\an8}<i>But at the same time,
what if I look weird?</i>

40
00:03:11,573 --> 00:03:14,993
{\an8}<i>I never dress like this,
so I feel a little self-conscious.</i>

41
00:03:15,952 --> 00:03:19,414
<i>I want to get his attention,
but then I don't.</i>

42
00:03:22,459 --> 00:03:23,877
[Taiki] Here looks good!

43
00:03:25,962 --> 00:03:28,465
- Watch out for rocks and stuff.
- Thank you.

44
00:03:32,469 --> 00:03:34,346
Looks like we still have ten minutes.

45
00:03:34,971 --> 00:03:35,972
Yeah, you're right.

46
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:38,016
Want anything to drink?

47
00:03:38,850 --> 00:03:39,893
Uh, no, thanks.

48
00:03:40,852 --> 00:03:43,396
[Taiki] <i>I thought this was
just a normal thing,</i>

49
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:45,857
<i>but she's definitely acting weird.</i>

50
00:03:47,234 --> 00:03:49,319
[mosquito buzzing]

51
00:03:50,153 --> 00:03:51,154
[grunts]

52
00:03:51,238 --> 00:03:52,739
[Taiki] <i>It's the mosquitoes.</i>

53
00:03:55,659 --> 00:03:58,411
- [Hina sighs]
<i>- And it looks like they already got her.</i>

54
00:03:59,162 --> 00:04:00,538
[bag crinkling]

55
00:04:00,622 --> 00:04:01,957
Here. I have this.

56
00:04:05,168 --> 00:04:06,169
Mm-mm.

57
00:04:06,253 --> 00:04:07,379
Thanks, Taiki.

58
00:04:07,963 --> 00:04:09,172
[Taiki] <i>Must be itchy.</i>

59
00:04:10,924 --> 00:04:14,552
Wait, you'll stain your <i>yukata</i> like that.
Let me.

60
00:04:15,136 --> 00:04:17,013
You needed to go a bit more left.

61
00:04:18,848 --> 00:04:21,643
<i>Uh, this is more awkward
than I thought it'd be.</i>

62
00:04:22,394 --> 00:04:24,896
Oh. She missed a strand...

63
00:04:28,942 --> 00:04:31,695
- So did you do your hair yourself?
- Hm?

64
00:04:32,696 --> 00:04:33,697
Yeah, I did.

65
00:04:34,364 --> 00:04:35,365
Why?

66
00:04:35,448 --> 00:04:37,701
It's pretty intricate,
so I'm a bit surprised.

67
00:04:37,784 --> 00:04:39,202
You're mocking me?

68
00:04:39,286 --> 00:04:41,329
No, I didn't mean it like that.

69
00:04:41,413 --> 00:04:42,998
I'm, like, genuinely impressed.

70
00:04:43,081 --> 00:04:45,750
Well, it sounds like
you're trying to provoke me!

71
00:04:45,834 --> 00:04:47,961
Oh, no! No, I missed a piece!

72
00:04:48,044 --> 00:04:50,046
I knew you were being sarcastic.

73
00:04:50,130 --> 00:04:51,798
You're taking it all wrong.

74
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:54,759
I can tell it wasn't easy,
and you did your best.

75
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,722
I thought it looked cute,
so I complimented you.

76
00:04:59,347 --> 00:05:01,099
[Hina] <i>Wait. "Cute"?</i>

77
00:05:02,309 --> 00:05:04,728
[gasps] Say that again!

78
00:05:04,811 --> 00:05:05,729
[exclaims softly]

79
00:05:06,938 --> 00:05:08,732
[all applauding]

80
00:05:09,691 --> 00:05:11,484
Oh, there's no pre-show.

81
00:05:11,568 --> 00:05:14,321
[firecrackers continue bursting]

82
00:05:17,574 --> 00:05:18,700
[chuckles]

83
00:05:19,367 --> 00:05:23,872
<i>Cute. Just saying one word
can make them so happy.</i>

84
00:05:28,460 --> 00:05:29,669
<i>Girls...</i>

85
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:43,266
[woman on PA] <i>There will now be
a 20-minute intermission.</i>

86
00:05:44,893 --> 00:05:46,895
Hey, I'm just gonna run to the bathroom.

87
00:05:46,978 --> 00:05:48,855
Yep. I'll watch our stuff.

88
00:05:51,608 --> 00:05:54,194
[chuckles] <i>He said I looked cute.</i>

89
00:05:57,989 --> 00:05:59,866
[Taiki] <i>Looks like I beat the crowd.</i>

90
00:06:00,533 --> 00:06:01,910
<i>Maybe I'll grab a drink.</i>

91
00:06:03,703 --> 00:06:05,622
<i>I wonder if Hina wants something.</i>

92
00:06:05,705 --> 00:06:06,915
[Chinatsu] Are you lost?

93
00:06:08,124 --> 00:06:11,795
- Oh, honey, you can't find your mom?
- [crying]

94
00:06:12,796 --> 00:06:14,464
You fell down, too, huh?

95
00:06:14,547 --> 00:06:16,925
Let's go to the front
and get some first aid.

96
00:06:17,008 --> 00:06:18,426
It's okay. It's okay.

97
00:06:19,385 --> 00:06:21,304
Pain, pain, go away.

98
00:06:21,387 --> 00:06:22,847
Go away!

99
00:06:23,890 --> 00:06:25,975
- Oh.
- [Taiki] Um...

100
00:06:26,601 --> 00:06:28,311
- Is she lost?
- Mm-hm.

101
00:06:28,394 --> 00:06:30,814
I think that she and her mom
got separated.

102
00:06:30,897 --> 00:06:33,817
I thought that I would
take her up to the main booth.

103
00:06:33,900 --> 00:06:35,068
Let me help you.

104
00:06:35,151 --> 00:06:36,069
What?

105
00:06:36,986 --> 00:06:38,321
Mind if I tag along?

106
00:06:38,404 --> 00:06:40,323
Oh, no, don't worry, I can handle it!

107
00:06:41,032 --> 00:06:42,951
I'm going that direction anyway.

108
00:06:44,536 --> 00:06:46,454
- What's your name?
- Yume.

109
00:06:46,538 --> 00:06:47,831
[Taiki] Hello, Yume!

110
00:06:48,748 --> 00:06:52,252
<i>I hate to keep Hina waiting,
but I can't not help.</i>

111
00:06:52,335 --> 00:06:53,169
[Yume] Wait!

112
00:06:56,047 --> 00:06:57,590
We're all going together!

113
00:07:06,224 --> 00:07:07,475
[Hina] <i>Good!</i>

114
00:07:07,559 --> 00:07:11,104
<i>I can't stand mosquitoes, usually.
But today, they did me a solid.</i>

115
00:07:11,938 --> 00:07:13,815
I thought that it looked cute.

116
00:07:14,566 --> 00:07:16,109
[laughs]

117
00:07:16,192 --> 00:07:17,819
- [boy] Chono?
- Hm?

118
00:07:19,404 --> 00:07:20,488
[Ito exclaims softly]

119
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,366
Ito, hi.

120
00:07:23,450 --> 00:07:25,785
I didn't know you'd be here.

121
00:07:25,869 --> 00:07:28,496
You're alone?
Wait. No, of course you aren't.

122
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:29,789
You here with teammates?

123
00:07:29,873 --> 00:07:31,875
Ah, no. I'm actually here with Taiki.

124
00:07:31,958 --> 00:07:32,959
Taiki?

125
00:07:34,627 --> 00:07:37,088
Yeah, Kyo was supposed
to be part of our group,

126
00:07:37,172 --> 00:07:38,631
but he came down with something.

127
00:07:38,715 --> 00:07:42,427
And another person said
she already had plans with other friends!

128
00:07:43,678 --> 00:07:45,680
Then... let's combine groups.

129
00:07:46,764 --> 00:07:49,142
Fireworks are more fun to watch
in a bigger group.

130
00:07:49,225 --> 00:07:51,394
Our legs are sour from standing,

131
00:07:51,478 --> 00:07:53,646
and to be honest,
we would love a place to sit down.

132
00:07:55,064 --> 00:07:56,232
What do you say?

133
00:07:59,736 --> 00:08:02,489
Hey, Yume, are you feeling thirsty at all?

134
00:08:02,572 --> 00:08:03,656
[Yume] No, thank you!

135
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:06,659
[Chinatsu] Okay. It's not too far,
so let's keep going.

136
00:08:06,743 --> 00:08:07,660
[Yume] 'Kay.

137
00:08:08,828 --> 00:08:12,499
[Taiki] <i>I didn't expect Chinatsu
to be so good with kids.</i>

138
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:17,170
<i>Maybe 'cause I only hear her
talk with upperclassmen.</i>

139
00:08:20,715 --> 00:08:21,925
Oh, I'm sorry.

140
00:08:22,008 --> 00:08:23,218
All good.

141
00:08:23,301 --> 00:08:24,928
<i>Whoa, this woman's beautiful.</i>

142
00:08:25,011 --> 00:08:27,680
- Are you okay?
- [Chinatsu] Karen!

143
00:08:27,764 --> 00:08:29,098
Chii!

144
00:08:29,182 --> 00:08:30,725
You two know each other?

145
00:08:30,808 --> 00:08:32,769
Of course! Karen's my best friend!

146
00:08:32,852 --> 00:08:34,938
She and I went
to the same elementary school.

147
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:37,941
[Taiki] <i>What a school that must've been!</i>

148
00:08:38,608 --> 00:08:39,734
Well, hi there.

149
00:08:39,817 --> 00:08:40,735
Good evening!

150
00:08:40,818 --> 00:08:42,654
- She's Haryu's girlfriend.
- What's your name?

151
00:08:42,737 --> 00:08:43,571
Yume!

152
00:08:43,655 --> 00:08:44,656
<i>Really?</i>

153
00:08:44,739 --> 00:08:47,450
- Are you here with Haryu?
- Yeah. He's in the seating area.

154
00:08:47,534 --> 00:08:49,202
[Taiki] <i>What?</i>

155
00:08:49,285 --> 00:08:52,413
<i>He did say he had a girlfriend
in show business.</i>

156
00:08:52,914 --> 00:08:53,957
By the way...

157
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,208
who's this?

158
00:08:56,543 --> 00:08:57,752
Hello.

159
00:08:57,835 --> 00:08:59,754
My name is Taiki Inomata.

160
00:08:59,837 --> 00:09:01,714
Haryu's really looked out
for me this year.

161
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:06,386
Wait, Inomata! Like, <i>the</i> "Taiki Inomata"?

162
00:09:07,136 --> 00:09:09,472
- Well, well, well! So you're him!
- Um...

163
00:09:09,556 --> 00:09:10,682
[Taiki] <i>"The"?</i>

164
00:09:11,349 --> 00:09:14,477
What kind of things
has Haryu been saying about me?

165
00:09:14,561 --> 00:09:15,395
Huh?

166
00:09:16,396 --> 00:09:17,230
Oh...

167
00:09:17,939 --> 00:09:19,023
He, um...

168
00:09:22,110 --> 00:09:23,987
said that you've got nerves of steel.

169
00:09:24,696 --> 00:09:26,239
[Taiki] <i>No freakin' way.</i>

170
00:09:26,990 --> 00:09:29,242
- Well, then, I'm going to scoot.
- [Yume] Huh?

171
00:09:29,867 --> 00:09:31,244
[Karen chuckles]

172
00:09:33,955 --> 00:09:36,541
Makes sense
that she is Haryu's girlfriend.

173
00:09:36,624 --> 00:09:38,251
Yep. They're a good match.

174
00:09:38,334 --> 00:09:41,754
[Karen chuckles]
<i>I'm glad I stumbled into that!</i>

175
00:09:45,466 --> 00:09:47,635
- [Karen] Kengo! Guess what?
- Hm?

176
00:09:47,719 --> 00:09:49,762
I have to tell you what I just saw!

177
00:09:49,846 --> 00:09:50,930
What was it?

178
00:09:51,014 --> 00:09:53,683
I bumped into Taiki Inomata
and Chii just now!

179
00:09:53,766 --> 00:09:55,059
Just the two of them?

180
00:09:55,143 --> 00:09:57,061
Well, there were three, to be precise.

181
00:09:58,896 --> 00:10:01,274
It didn't look like
they were on a date, though.

182
00:10:02,525 --> 00:10:03,818
Seems like a good kid.

183
00:10:03,901 --> 00:10:05,194
Taiki Inomata.

184
00:10:05,862 --> 00:10:07,530
They should get together already.

185
00:10:07,614 --> 00:10:09,949
I just don't think
that's where her head is at.

186
00:10:10,491 --> 00:10:12,035
Ah, makes sense.

187
00:10:13,745 --> 00:10:14,662
What's up?

188
00:10:15,246 --> 00:10:17,790
If you ever start
to slack off in badminton,

189
00:10:17,874 --> 00:10:19,167
I am gonna end this!

190
00:10:19,250 --> 00:10:20,752
Yes, I'm aware of that, Karen.

191
00:10:21,502 --> 00:10:23,921
My heart's with you and badminton.

192
00:10:24,005 --> 00:10:25,423
[Karen] That's what I wanna hear!

193
00:10:27,258 --> 00:10:31,346
<i>It does seem like Chii is really
overthinking some things in her life.</i>

194
00:10:32,513 --> 00:10:33,973
FIREWORKS FESTIVAL
OPERATIONS

195
00:10:34,057 --> 00:10:35,183
[man] You're lost?

196
00:10:35,266 --> 00:10:38,269
{\an8}Gosh, her mother was just here
a minute ago.

197
00:10:38,353 --> 00:10:40,188
{\an8}She went off to go look again.

198
00:10:40,271 --> 00:10:42,190
{\an8}I'll make an announcement now.

199
00:10:43,149 --> 00:10:44,817
I'll look for her mom!

200
00:10:44,901 --> 00:10:47,945
Why don't the two of you stay right here.
I'll be back!

201
00:10:50,531 --> 00:10:52,950
Why don't we wait inside the booth, okay?

202
00:10:53,034 --> 00:10:54,952
{\an8}RECEPTION

203
00:10:55,995 --> 00:10:58,998
That lady we met... Her <i>yukata</i> was pretty.

204
00:10:59,082 --> 00:11:00,500
Yeah, it was.

205
00:11:00,583 --> 00:11:02,960
It had so many flowers, it was super cute!

206
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:06,464
So you didn't wanna wear one? A <i>yukata?</i>

207
00:11:07,590 --> 00:11:08,925
Mmmm...

208
00:11:09,675 --> 00:11:10,718
Only a bit.

209
00:11:11,469 --> 00:11:14,680
Then again, this T-shirt
is one of my absolute favorites.

210
00:11:14,764 --> 00:11:16,724
Don't you think
the design is pretty, Yume?

211
00:11:16,808 --> 00:11:18,351
That's your best shirt?

212
00:11:18,434 --> 00:11:20,853
- You have more refined style than I do.
- [laughs]

213
00:11:21,437 --> 00:11:22,438
But I guess...

214
00:11:22,939 --> 00:11:25,233
the best clothing I own is my uniform.

215
00:11:26,192 --> 00:11:27,485
Yoo-mi-form?

216
00:11:27,985 --> 00:11:31,447
It's what you wear when
you're playing a sport. I play basketball.

217
00:11:31,531 --> 00:11:32,740
I know basketball!

218
00:11:33,324 --> 00:11:34,700
[Chinatsu] <i>Wearing that uniform...</i>

219
00:11:34,784 --> 00:11:37,745
<i>It makes me want to be
the coolest version of myself.</i>

220
00:11:38,329 --> 00:11:39,247
[Karen] <i>What?</i>

221
00:11:39,330 --> 00:11:41,749
You're living with a first-year boy?

222
00:11:41,833 --> 00:11:43,000
We're cohabitating.

223
00:11:43,084 --> 00:11:45,002
That's literally the same thing!

224
00:11:45,086 --> 00:11:48,756
Don't you get self-conscious?
Like, when he looks manly...

225
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,800
or does something you like?

226
00:11:52,844 --> 00:11:54,053
Yeah, I do.

227
00:11:55,972 --> 00:11:56,806
<i>But...</i>

228
00:11:58,516 --> 00:12:01,269
Looking for Yume's mother! Yume's mother?

229
00:12:03,354 --> 00:12:05,815
I'm awkward
when it comes to things like this.

230
00:12:05,898 --> 00:12:07,775
Wearing a <i>yukata</i> is just too much.

231
00:12:07,859 --> 00:12:10,278
[gasps] I know, right?

232
00:12:10,361 --> 00:12:11,279
Huh?

233
00:12:11,362 --> 00:12:14,323
{\an8}I was trying to put on my <i>yukata</i>
all by myself!

234
00:12:14,407 --> 00:12:15,908
{\an8}But it got messy, you know?

235
00:12:15,992 --> 00:12:18,703
{\an8}And my mom ended up
having to help me get dressed!

236
00:12:19,370 --> 00:12:21,038
[laughs]

237
00:12:21,122 --> 00:12:22,582
It is tricky, huh?

238
00:12:22,665 --> 00:12:24,041
[Taiki] Hey!

239
00:12:24,125 --> 00:12:25,543
[Yume's mother panting]

240
00:12:26,210 --> 00:12:27,295
Yume!

241
00:12:27,378 --> 00:12:28,838
Mama!

242
00:12:29,881 --> 00:12:32,967
- Mama! [cries]
- Where have you been?

243
00:12:33,509 --> 00:12:34,802
Mama!

244
00:12:37,138 --> 00:12:40,349
She heard the announcement,
so it was easy to find her.

245
00:12:40,433 --> 00:12:41,559
What a relief.

246
00:12:42,185 --> 00:12:44,562
Really. I cannot thank you enough.

247
00:12:44,645 --> 00:12:46,856
Is there something that I can...

248
00:12:46,939 --> 00:12:48,065
Oh, not at all!

249
00:12:50,485 --> 00:12:52,069
Stick to your mom like glue.

250
00:12:52,987 --> 00:12:54,280
[exclaims softly]

251
00:12:57,909 --> 00:12:58,993
Yume?

252
00:12:59,076 --> 00:13:00,119
Hold on!

253
00:13:02,622 --> 00:13:03,539
[clicking]

254
00:13:05,082 --> 00:13:06,083
It's for you!

255
00:13:06,167 --> 00:13:07,084
[exclaims]

256
00:13:07,668 --> 00:13:10,087
Dressing up in a <i>yukata</i> is hard...

257
00:13:10,171 --> 00:13:11,839
but wearing a clip is simple!

258
00:13:12,465 --> 00:13:14,091
You look way more stylish now!

259
00:13:14,884 --> 00:13:15,843
But it...

260
00:13:16,719 --> 00:13:19,597
Ah could you keep it, please?
It would mean a lot to her!

261
00:13:22,475 --> 00:13:23,309
[giggles]

262
00:13:25,353 --> 00:13:26,646
I'd be glad to.

263
00:13:31,901 --> 00:13:32,944
[Yume] Bye-bye!

264
00:13:33,945 --> 00:13:34,862
Come on, let's go.

265
00:13:37,949 --> 00:13:40,243
- [Taiki laughs]
- What are you laughing at?

266
00:13:41,202 --> 00:13:42,453
[Taiki] Oh, no, I'm not...

267
00:13:42,537 --> 00:13:44,622
[continues laughing]

268
00:13:45,248 --> 00:13:46,499
You're being a butthead.

269
00:13:47,959 --> 00:13:49,919
{\an8}You're ruining her kind gesture.

270
00:13:50,002 --> 00:13:51,379
{\an8}[Taiki] And it looks great.

271
00:13:52,046 --> 00:13:54,382
In fact, I hope you wear it
all the time now.

272
00:13:54,465 --> 00:13:55,675
[Chinatsu groans]

273
00:13:55,758 --> 00:13:56,884
[Taiki laughs]

274
00:13:56,968 --> 00:13:58,928
[Chinatsu] You're laughing again.

275
00:13:59,011 --> 00:14:01,138
[Taiki] Well, you're just
silently staring at me.

276
00:14:02,098 --> 00:14:04,016
And make sure you wear it till we're home.

277
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,893
'Cause she'll get bummed out,

278
00:14:05,977 --> 00:14:08,396
if she sees you later
and you're not wearing it.

279
00:14:08,479 --> 00:14:10,356
I'm gonna keep it on, obviously.

280
00:14:10,898 --> 00:14:13,150
She helped me look fashionable,
and it won't be in vain.

281
00:14:13,234 --> 00:14:16,112
[Taiki chuckles]
Then why don't I take your photo?

282
00:14:16,195 --> 00:14:17,738
[Chinatsu] I do not consent.

283
00:14:17,822 --> 00:14:19,657
[Taiki] I didn't consent at the aquarium.

284
00:14:20,783 --> 00:14:24,579
<i>If I told Chinatsu right now,
that I think she looks cute...</i>

285
00:14:25,288 --> 00:14:26,914
<i>I'm sure there'd be a pause...</i>

286
00:14:28,165 --> 00:14:31,168
<i>and then she'd say
"thank you" to be polite...</i>

287
00:14:31,252 --> 00:14:33,713
<i>and then all the fun of the night
would come to an end.</i>

288
00:14:33,796 --> 00:14:34,922
[firecrackers bursting]

289
00:14:35,006 --> 00:14:36,674
[all cheering, applauding]

290
00:14:39,510 --> 00:14:40,678
[Chinatsu gasps]

291
00:14:45,808 --> 00:14:47,143
[Chinatsu] Intermission's over.

292
00:14:47,852 --> 00:14:48,686
[Taiki] Yeah.

293
00:14:55,401 --> 00:14:56,694
You should be getting back.

294
00:14:59,322 --> 00:15:01,908
Nagisa and the others
are waiting for me, too.

295
00:15:05,578 --> 00:15:06,704
[Taiki] Yeah, you're right.

296
00:15:09,540 --> 00:15:11,459
Then I'll see you at home.

297
00:15:12,126 --> 00:15:13,753
Yeah. See you.

298
00:15:15,546 --> 00:15:17,298
[Taiki running, panting]

299
00:15:19,091 --> 00:15:22,553
<i>Dang. I left Hina waiting
way longer than I meant to.</i>

300
00:15:23,804 --> 00:15:26,098
Come and get a knuckle sandwich.
Got it, punk?

301
00:15:26,182 --> 00:15:29,477
[Taiki] <i>It's just us two,
and I left her alone. I gotta apologize.</i>

302
00:15:32,688 --> 00:15:33,731
I'm back.

303
00:15:35,274 --> 00:15:36,484
Welcome back.

304
00:15:37,068 --> 00:15:39,028
I'm sorry. That was a long time.

305
00:15:39,111 --> 00:15:40,196
You're gonna owe me.

306
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:41,489
Ah, I don't like that.

307
00:15:43,074 --> 00:15:45,242
While I was gone, was everything okay?

308
00:15:47,078 --> 00:15:48,079
Yeah.

309
00:15:48,579 --> 00:15:50,122
The food stands are great.

310
00:15:50,748 --> 00:15:53,125
The fireworks are beautiful.
This is the best!

311
00:15:54,627 --> 00:15:56,128
We should come again next year.

312
00:15:57,129 --> 00:15:58,130
Yeah, we should.

313
00:15:59,715 --> 00:16:02,093
[Hina] <i>What I really meant
when I said that</i>

314
00:16:02,176 --> 00:16:04,929
<i>was "just the two of us again."</i>

315
00:16:11,686 --> 00:16:13,396
[Sana] Hey, Chinatsu, you're back.

316
00:16:14,397 --> 00:16:16,649
Where'd you get that barrette from?

317
00:16:16,732 --> 00:16:18,401
[Chinatsu] It's a long story.

318
00:16:19,026 --> 00:16:22,029
By the way, Chii... why do you look so sad?

319
00:16:23,197 --> 00:16:24,156
[exclaims softly]

320
00:16:26,659 --> 00:16:29,578
[Taiki] <i>What is next year
going to look like for all of us?</i>

321
00:16:30,788 --> 00:16:32,415
<i>A year is a long time.</i>

322
00:16:32,999 --> 00:16:35,626
<i>What's going to change
between now and then?</i>

323
00:16:38,546 --> 00:16:40,965
<i>Those questions come and go,</i>

324
00:16:41,048 --> 00:16:43,843
<i>just like the fireworks
in the night's sky.</i>

325
00:16:48,556 --> 00:16:49,765
[insects trilling]

326
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:52,143
Morning, Yukiko.

327
00:16:52,727 --> 00:16:54,228
Morning, Chinatsu.

328
00:16:54,311 --> 00:16:56,147
You are right on time for breakfast.

329
00:16:59,025 --> 00:17:00,901
Oh, is Taiki up already?

330
00:17:00,985 --> 00:17:02,737
He went out on a run.

331
00:17:03,487 --> 00:17:05,823
He's just raring
to go first thing in the morning!

332
00:17:05,906 --> 00:17:08,242
<i>He said the practice the other day
made him realize</i>

333
00:17:08,325 --> 00:17:12,079
how much he needs to work on his stamina,
so he was all fired up!

334
00:17:12,163 --> 00:17:13,414
[inspiring music playing]

335
00:17:13,497 --> 00:17:15,541
[ball dribbling]

336
00:17:16,250 --> 00:17:17,334
[player] Heads up!

337
00:17:17,877 --> 00:17:19,462
[pants]

338
00:17:28,387 --> 00:17:29,847
[whistle blows]

339
00:17:32,391 --> 00:17:36,187
Natsu, you could've made that pass
back there to Nagisa instead.

340
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:37,813
She didn't have anyone on her.

341
00:17:37,897 --> 00:17:40,399
Keep a cool head,
even when we're short on time.

342
00:17:40,483 --> 00:17:41,317
Right.

343
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:43,569
I know that nationals are coming up soon,

344
00:17:43,652 --> 00:17:45,529
but don't let them
interfere with your playing.

345
00:17:45,613 --> 00:17:46,822
Just do your thing, you know?

346
00:17:46,906 --> 00:17:49,825
You've got this in the bag, Chinatsu.
I guarantee it.

347
00:17:49,909 --> 00:17:50,826
Okay!

348
00:17:56,332 --> 00:17:57,249
Yeah!

349
00:17:58,834 --> 00:17:59,835
Another day another win.

350
00:18:00,544 --> 00:18:03,089
[boy 2] We're not even close
to the same level anymore.

351
00:18:03,172 --> 00:18:05,841
[boy 1] Yeah, I mean,
he did qualify for nationals.

352
00:18:06,550 --> 00:18:08,344
[Taiki] <i>At practice the other day...</i>

353
00:18:08,427 --> 00:18:11,013
<i>the gap between Haryu and Hyodo's scores</i>

354
00:18:11,097 --> 00:18:13,808
<i>was smaller than it was
at prefectural qualifiers.</i>

355
00:18:17,436 --> 00:18:19,814
There are two slots
for nationals next year.

356
00:18:20,397 --> 00:18:21,857
My money's on Haryu and Yusa to go.

357
00:18:21,941 --> 00:18:25,319
If you'd swung like that before,
you could've scored more points on Yusa.

358
00:18:25,402 --> 00:18:26,445
Want some?

359
00:18:27,196 --> 00:18:28,114
[scoffs]

360
00:18:28,739 --> 00:18:30,449
Kyo, feed me some shuttles!

361
00:18:30,533 --> 00:18:31,367
Huh?

362
00:18:34,537 --> 00:18:36,997
[Taiki] <i>Having Hyodo
say something like that...</i>

363
00:18:37,790 --> 00:18:39,875
<i>makes me want to work as hard as they do.</i>

364
00:18:40,584 --> 00:18:42,545
Whoa, Kyo! That's a bit fast!

365
00:18:45,131 --> 00:18:47,299
Excuse me! I just gotta grab the shuttle!

366
00:18:48,050 --> 00:18:49,552
Hina, it came pretty clo--

367
00:18:49,635 --> 00:18:52,054
[humming, singing softly]

368
00:18:57,810 --> 00:18:58,644
Keep it up.

369
00:19:01,730 --> 00:19:03,232
- Did you not hear that?
- Huh?

370
00:19:04,275 --> 00:19:05,568
Huh? Hear what?

371
00:19:05,651 --> 00:19:06,986
[sighs]

372
00:19:07,069 --> 00:19:09,321
- This is what I'm talking about.
- Huh?

373
00:19:09,905 --> 00:19:11,657
[Niina] Never mind. Don't change, friend.

374
00:19:11,740 --> 00:19:13,117
[Hina] Wait I wanna know!

375
00:19:13,909 --> 00:19:16,829
[balls dribbling, sneakers skidding]

376
00:19:17,454 --> 00:19:20,374
[Kikuchi] Let's take lunch!
We'll be back again at 1:20!

377
00:19:20,457 --> 00:19:21,333
[girls] Okay!

378
00:19:21,417 --> 00:19:23,335
- [exclaims]
- I'll open some windows.

379
00:19:23,419 --> 00:19:24,378
You're the best.

380
00:19:37,057 --> 00:19:38,058
[exclaims softly]

381
00:19:39,643 --> 00:19:41,228
[snoring]

382
00:19:44,857 --> 00:19:45,691
Taiki?

383
00:19:47,735 --> 00:19:48,611
You asleep?

384
00:19:51,447 --> 00:19:53,449
<i>He did go for a run this morning.</i>

385
00:19:54,992 --> 00:19:57,119
<i>He cuddles his tracksuit when he sleeps.</i>

386
00:19:57,203 --> 00:19:58,370
DOESN'T USE IT AS A BLANKET...

387
00:19:59,205 --> 00:20:00,206
Hello.

388
00:20:00,956 --> 00:20:02,917
Mr. Inomata.

389
00:20:04,627 --> 00:20:08,088
There's something that I wanted
to ask you the other day.

390
00:20:09,548 --> 00:20:10,549
You and Hina...

391
00:20:11,175 --> 00:20:13,469
Have the two of you started going out?

392
00:20:16,013 --> 00:20:21,310
How you answer will determine the feelings
I have about being your housemate.

393
00:20:22,603 --> 00:20:24,146
<i>I guess it's obvious they're dating.</i>

394
00:20:24,772 --> 00:20:27,149
<i>They went
to the fireworks festival together.</i>

395
00:20:28,192 --> 00:20:31,278
<i>And I already know
that Hina has a crush on Taiki.</i>

396
00:20:31,362 --> 00:20:32,529
[mellow music playing]

397
00:20:32,613 --> 00:20:34,156
If you are dating...

398
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:36,158
I wish you would've said so.

399
00:20:37,076 --> 00:20:38,911
Are you going to go to the festival?

400
00:20:39,703 --> 00:20:41,038
Yeah, with some friends.

401
00:20:41,705 --> 00:20:45,209
[Chinatsu] <i>You didn't have to do that.
Lie about going with friends.</i>

402
00:20:47,753 --> 00:20:50,214
If you would've told me, then I...

403
00:21:18,575 --> 00:21:22,121
Knowing you lied to me...
I can't help but feel sad.

404
00:21:25,791 --> 00:21:27,501
[wind blowing]

405
00:21:31,630 --> 00:21:32,881
[grunts softly]

406
00:21:36,135 --> 00:21:38,012
[yawns]

407
00:21:38,762 --> 00:21:40,514
Ah, that was a great nap.

408
00:21:49,356 --> 00:21:52,151
<i>It almost feels like someone was here...</i>

409
00:21:52,234 --> 00:21:53,152
<i>But maybe...</i>

410
00:21:54,361 --> 00:21:55,863
<i>I imagined it.</i>

411
00:22:05,456 --> 00:22:07,458
[closing theme song playing]
